{%- comment -%}
  博客、论文札记、见山共用的栏目页（书房式）：紧凑页头 + 左侧筛选（排序 / 分类 / 标签）+ 卡片网格。
  页面 front matter：
    feed_kinds     要列出的文章 kind，例如 [writing]、[paper-note]、[note]
    feed_podcasts  可选，排进网格的播客（_data/listen/<slug>.yml），卡片指向 /notes/podcast/
    empty_text     可选，栏目里还没有内容时的一句话
  标题与介绍取 blog_name / blog_description，没有时取 title / description。
  筛选与排序只在当前页的卡片里进行（blog-cards.js），不发请求。
{%- endcomment -%}
{% assign all_posts = site.posts | where: 'lang', 'zh' %}
{% assign postlist = '' | split: '' %}
{% for post in all_posts %}
  {% if page.feed_kinds contains post.kind %}
    {% assign postlist = postlist | push: post %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% assign podcast_slugs = page.feed_podcasts | default: empty %}
{% assign item_count = postlist.size | plus: podcast_slugs.size %}
{% assign writing_categories = '' %}
{% assign writing_tags = '' %}
{% if podcast_slugs.size > 0 %}
  {% assign writing_categories = '播客|' %}
{% endif %}
{% for post in postlist %}
  {% for category in post.categories %}
    {% unless writing_categories contains category %}
      {% assign writing_categories = writing_categories | append: category | append: '|' %}
    {% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% for tag in post.tags %}
    {% unless writing_tags contains tag %}
      {% assign writing_tags = writing_tags | append: tag | append: '|' %}
    {% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% assign writing_categories = writing_categories | split: '|' %}
{% assign writing_tags = writing_tags | split: '|' %}

<div class="writing-page">
  <header class="writing-hero">
    <div class="writing-hero-copy">
      <h1>{{ page.blog_name | default: page.title }}</h1>
      <p>{{ page.blog_description | default: page.description }}</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="writing-layout">
    {%- comment -%}
      手机上（≤760px）三组筛选收成一行「筛选」按钮，点开从底部升起（blog-cards.js 把侧栏搬进面板）；
      这样第一屏就能看到文章。按钮在有脚本时从第一帧就占好位置，没有脚本时不出现。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <button
      type="button"
      class="writing-filter-trigger"
      aria-haspopup="dialog"
      aria-controls="writing-filter-sheet"
      hidden
    >
      <span>筛选</span>
      <span class="writing-filter-trigger__state" data-writing-summary>最新在前</span>
    </button>
    <dialog class="writing-filter-sheet" id="writing-filter-sheet" aria-labelledby="writing-filter-sheet-title">
      <div class="writing-filter-sheet__head">
        <h2 id="writing-filter-sheet-title">筛选</h2>
        <button type="button" data-writing-sheet-close>完成</button>
      </div>
    </dialog>
    <aside class="writing-filters" aria-label="筛选文章" hidden>
      <details class="writing-filter" data-open-on-wide>
        <summary>排序</summary>
        <div class="writing-filter-options" role="radiogroup" aria-label="排序">
          <button type="button" data-writing-sort="new" aria-pressed="true">最新在前</button>
          <button type="button" data-writing-sort="old" aria-pressed="false">最早在前</button>
        </div>
      </details>
      {% if writing_categories.size > 0 %}
        <details class="writing-filter" data-open-on-wide>
          <summary>分类</summary>
          <div class="writing-filter-options">
            <button type="button" data-writing-category="" aria-pressed="true">全部</button>
            {% for category in writing_categories %}
              <button type="button" data-writing-category="{{ category | escape }}" aria-pressed="false">
                {{- category | escape -}}
              </button>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </details>
      {% endif %}
      {% if writing_tags.size > 0 %}
        <details class="writing-filter">
          <summary>标签</summary>
          <div class="writing-filter-options">
            <button type="button" data-writing-tag="" aria-pressed="true">全部</button>
            {% for tag in writing_tags %}
              <button type="button" data-writing-tag="{{ tag | escape }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ tag | escape }}</button>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </details>
      {% endif %}
    </aside>
    {%- comment -%}
      窄屏上筛选默认收起（HTML 里就是收起的），免得把文章挤到第二屏；宽屏在第一帧之前同步展开。
      不在 blog-cards.js 里改：那时页面已经画出来，窄屏上收起会把整列文章往上拽（CLS）。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <script>
      if (!window.matchMedia('(max-width: 760px)').matches) {
        document.querySelectorAll('.writing-filters details[data-open-on-wide]').forEach((details) => {
          details.open = true;
        });
      }
    </script>

    <section class="writing-feed" id="writing-grid" aria-labelledby="writing-feed-title">
      <h2 id="writing-feed-title" class="sr-only">{{ page.blog_name | default: page.title }}的全部内容</h2>
      <div class="writing-grid">
        {%- comment -%} 播客按 added 日期插进文章之间，初始顺序与「最新在前」一致。 {%- endcomment -%}
        {% assign podcasts_done = '' %}
        {% for post in postlist %}
          {% assign post_day = post.date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' %}
          {% for slug in podcast_slugs %}
            {% assign podcast_day = site.data.listen[slug].added | date: '%Y-%m-%d' %}
            {% unless podcasts_done contains slug %}
              {% if podcast_day >= post_day %}
                {% include listen-lane-card.liquid series=slug %}
                {% assign podcasts_done = podcasts_done | append: slug | append: '|' %}
              {% endif %}
            {% endunless %}
          {% endfor %}
          {% include writing-card.liquid post=post index=forloop.index0 %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% for slug in podcast_slugs %}
          {% unless podcasts_done contains slug %}
            {% include listen-lane-card.liquid series=slug %}
          {% endunless %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p
        class="writing-empty"
        {% if item_count > 0 %}
          hidden
        {% endif %}
      >
        {%- if item_count > 0 -%}这个筛选下还没有内容。{%- else -%}{{ page.empty_text | default: '暂时还没有公开内容。' }}{%- endif -%}
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/blog-cards.js' | relative_url | bust_file_cache }}" defer></script>
